    %% Integrity/authorization invariants (not columns or extra tables):
    %% - Task valid finality, not passing quiz score, drives completion & practiced skills.
    %% - Task rubric is optional for quiz only; no free-form auto-grade.
    %% - ScenarioVersion is pinned; model answers remain hidden until task unlock.
    %% - AgentConfiguration published versions immutable; only Admin assigns Student.
    %% - Student can run active assigned Agent; KB access uses explicit config grant.
    %% - AGENT_EXECUTION.sessionId is NULLABLE: optional Student session; Admin preview
    %%   has no session. executionMode and initiator identify actor.
    %% - Never fabricate a Student session for an Admin Agent preview/test. AgentExecution
    %%   references AgentConfiguration; independent Admin KB Studio Test may be audited
    %%   separately rather than forcibly mapped to AgentExecution.
    %% - KB assets have ingestion and publication lifecycles; invalid parse cannot replace published source.
    %% - Student-uploaded chat files and second-Agent critique are DEFERRED.
    %% - InsightReport only on Student request, schema-validated, owner-only.
    %% - ExplorationPlan only persisted after clear Student confirmation.
    %% - summarySourceRefs lists source session/interaction IDs (incl. same-user previous
    %%   sessions and transitive lineage); summaryStatus tracks NONE/VALID/INVALIDATED.
    %% - When any source chat/interaction is deleted, every dependent summary is INVALIDATED
    %%   and cannot be reused until regenerated from still-permitted user-owned data.
    %% - summaryUpdatedAt records latest summary generation/invalidation timestamp.
    %% - No guessed 30/90-day history retention; policy remains OPEN.

    %% v1.2 integrity constraints and modes:
    %% AGENT_SESSION.configurationId NOT NULL, foreign key to immutable published config,
    %% pinned at chat creation and never changed by subsequent publish.
    %% AGENT_EXECUTION.sessionId, inputInteractionId, configurationId, knowledgeBaseId
    %% are NULLABLE as appropriate; inputSnapshot required for trace of standalone tests.
    %% STUDENT_CHAT: session/config/interaction required and config matches session.
    %% ADMIN_PREVIEW: config required; session/interaction optional NULL, input required.
    %% KB_TEST: KB required; config/session/interaction optional NULL; input required.
    %% All modes track initiator, evidence, timing, status, tools, and model usage when
    %% available; retrieval-only KB Test may have NULL tokens/cost (not fabricated).
    %% KNOWLEDGE_BASE.scopeType PLATFORM or ENTERPRISE; enterpriseId NULL iff PLATFORM;
    %% enterpriseId REQUIRED if ENTERPRISE. MVP allows PLATFORM KB workflows only.
    %% Tenant KB requires explicit access grants, not scope inference.
